    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      494.59,
      298.2,
      557.66
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      572.59,
      298.2,
      674.66
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of land described in below name and extent, depicted in the Advance Tracing No. KE/RMB/2023/427 dated 27.09.2024, prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys, Kegalle District, situated at the Village of Naththambura, in Grama Niladhari Division No. 3 Naththambura, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Rambukkana of Kegalle District, Sabaragamuwa Province and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      306.57,
      446.15,
      549.66,
      565.22
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Maraagahamulahena Denata Waththa alias Maragahamulahena alias Appuwage Waththa - Extent: 0.0160 Hectare North: Lot Nos. 203, 30 and 24 of FVP 129; East: Lot Nos. 24, 209 and 208 of FVP 129; South: Lot Nos. 208 and 204 of FVP 129; West: Lot Nos. 204 and 203 of FVP 129. K. D. L\u0d7a\u0d85 K\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.",
